{"products":[{"id":8607978782951,"title":"Bronx Bombers Heavyweight Crewnecks","handle":"bronx-bombers-patch-on-black-crewneck","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Bronx Bombers Heavyweight Crewneck carries New York power without raising its voice. PJ’s 2016 triple entendre; inspired by aviation muscle, stadium nights, street mythology, \u0026amp; the kind of confidence that doesn’t need explanation, the graphic hits with bold symmetry \u0026amp; layered meaning; iconic, grounded, \u0026amp; unmistakably New York.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCut from a substantial 13.5 oz heavyweight fleece, this crewneck delivers real structure, warmth, \u0026amp; durability. The fabric feels dense yet comfortable, with a smooth cotton face that keeps the print crisp while wearing clean over time. Built to hold its shape, break in slowly, \u0026amp; age with character, it’s the kind of piece that earns its place in rotation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEqually at home on cold platforms, late walks, ballpark exits, or everyday city movement, this crewneck balances toughness with polish. No flash. No excess. Just weight, intention, \u0026amp; presence.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNew York energy—heavy, composed, \u0026amp; impossible to ignore.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDetails-\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e13.5 oz.\/yd² (US) \/ 22.5 oz.\/L yd (CA) heavyweight fleece\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e70\/30 ring-spun cotton \/ polyester 3-end fleece\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e100% cotton face yarns on solid colors for premium print clarity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDouble ribbing side panels for stretch \u0026amp; mobility\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eReverse coverstitch sewing on all seams for durability \u0026amp; clean finish\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCross-grain body construction to reduce shrinkage after wash\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e520gm 100% cotton 1x1 ribbing at cuffs \u0026amp; waistband\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2026-01-07T10:45:11-05:00","created_at":"2024-01-11T15:37:55-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:43-04:00","vendor":"PJ O'Rourke","product_type":"","tags":["Bronx Bombers","Bronx Bombers Crewneck","Crewneck","Screen Print"],"variants":[{"id":50060024283367,"title":"Small \/ Navy","option1":"Small","option2":"Navy","option3":null,"sku":"","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":{"id":48911211921639,"product_id":8607978782951,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-01-20T18:17:14-05:00","updated_at":"2026-01-20T18:17:31-05:00","alt":null,"width":1024,"height":1024,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0579\/8045\/3021\/files\/IMG-8001.png?v=1768951051","variant_ids":[50060024283367,50060024348903,50060024414439,50060024479975,50060024545511,50060024611047]},"available":true,"price":"195.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8607978782951,"created_at":"2024-08-05T08:53:18-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:43-04:00"},{"id":50060024316135,"title":"Small \/ White","option1":"Small","option2":"White","option3":null,"sku":"","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":{"id":48822746611943,"product_id":8607978782951,"position":2,"created_at":"2026-01-07T11:23:14-05:00","updated_at":"2026-01-20T18:17:31-05:00","alt":null,"width":1321,"height":1302,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0579\/8045\/3021\/files\/bronx-bombers-heavyweight-crewneck-grey_020649fb-8272-4c42-b3f2-cbfa5a78d4ab.png?v=1768951051","variant_ids":[50060024316135,50060024381671,50060024447207,50060024512743,5006002457827